      "content": "thanks. i wanted to ask about the methods used during the war. the FLN used a lot of guerrilla warfare and urban attacks that caused a lot of casualties among civilians and settlers. some people at the time argued these tactics were just terrorism. how do you view that? was it a legitimate part of a liberation struggle, or was it just violence for the sake of it?",
